      "status": "PASS_STATIC",
      "review": "visibilitychange cancels and clears scheduled frames while hidden and clears timing before resumption; tick also stops if hidden. pagehide now clears its frame id and timing, allowing pageshow to resume scheduling. activeSeconds uses visible-frame deltas capped at 0.05 seconds, so hidden wall time is not added. Real navigation/BFCache behavior was not exercised by this reviewer."
    },
